es","authorUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoxiaoSean","githubUrl":"https://github.com/xiaoxiaosean/tangerine-zip","externalId":"3762","sourceName":"HelloGitHub·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-23T13:18:54Z","sourceIds":["hellogithub-issues"],"productId":"prd_4714e7ed2213546615985e07","projectPath":"/projects/xiaoxiaosean/tangerine-zip/","trendDate":"2026-09-23","taxonomy":{"languages":["csharp"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/jidekaixin2dian/fps-tune","tags":["hellogithub","submission"],"image":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jidekaixin2dian/fps-tune/main/assets/screenshots/01-overview.png","title":"提交项目：FPS 帧律（C#）","author":"jidekaixin2dian","github":{"url":"https://github.com/jidekaixin2dian/fps-tune","name":"jidekaixin2dian/fps-tune","forks":0,"stars":2,"topics":["agent-skills","ai-agent","apex-legends","cli-tool","cs2","csharp","delta-force","dotnet","dotnet10","fps","fps-optimization","game-performance","pc-gaming","powershell","pubg","system-tuning","valorant","windows","windows-optimization","wpf"],"license":"MIT","archived":false,"homepage":"","language":"C#","pushedAt":"2026-09-21T12:35:16Z","createdAt":"2026-08-31T03:34:16Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-21T14:34:43Z","openIssues":2,"description":"Windows 系统层帧率调校台：33 项优化全部可还原、不碰游戏文件，结论来自本机 A/B 实测。C# WPF + .NET 10，带无头 CLI 与 SKILL.md（AI Agent 可直接驱动）。适用于三角洲行动 / CS2 / 无畏契约 / APEX / PUBG。","snapshotDate":"2026-09-21","defaultBranch":"main"},"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jidekaixin2dian/fps-tune/main/assets/screenshots/01-overview.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jidekaixin2dian/fps-tune/main/assets/screenshots/05-ab-experiment.png"],"metrics":{"comments":0},"summary":"面向 FPS 玩家的 Windows 系统层调校工具（C# WPF + .NET 10）。它只改系统设置——注册表、电源计划、服务启动类型、启动配置，共 33 个优化项，全部集中在一个 catalog.json 里可以直接读完改了什么。每次写入前先备份原值（包括\"这个键原本不存在\"这种状态），所以能精确还原，也支持逐项还原。GUI 与无头 CLI 共用同一套引擎，附带 A/B 实验向导：改完自动对比平均帧率 / 1% low / P99 帧时间，没有可测收益的改动会被自动撤回。适用于《三角洲行动》《CS2》《无畏契约》《APEX》等，不针对特定游戏。 亮点 同类工具基本都是闭源 + 专有 EULA（禁止修改与再分发），并且不会告诉你它到底改了哪些键、也回不去。这个项目的差异点正好是这三件事：MIT 开源、clean-room 自写、改动全部可还原。另外它内置了\"不承诺帧数\"的机制——性能会话在本机采样 CPU/内存/GPU/显存，A/B 实验用规则判定收益，没提升就自动还原，避免\"玄学优化\"。仓库里还有一份 SKILL.md，把工具当作 AI Agent 的执行后端，Agent 只负责解释与确认，改动由确定性引擎完成。 截图或演示 我是这个项目的作者。目前是 0.1 Beta，二进制未做代码签名，Issues 我都回。","issueUrl":"https://github.com/521xueweihan/HelloGitHub/issues/3751","sourceId":"hellogithub-issues","authorUrl":"https://github.com/jidekaixin2dian","githubUrl":"https://github.com/jidekaixin2dian/fps-tune","externalId":"3751","sourceName":"HelloGitHub·用户投稿","publishedAt":"2026-09-21T09:28:20Z","titleZh":"提交项目：FPS 帧律（C#）","summaryZh":"面向 FPS 玩家的 Windows 系统层调校工具（C# WPF + .NET 10）。","titleEn":"FPS FrameRate: Windows System Tuning for FPS Gamers (C#)","summaryEn":"Windows tuning tool for FPS gamers (C#) applying 33 registry, power, service and startup tweaks from one catalog.json, with per-item rollback. GUI and headless CLI share an engine; an A/B wizard auto-reverts gains that aren't measurable.","sourceIds":["hellogithub-issues","weekly-issues"],"productId":"prd_f6928b6e70e158f116d39b8d","projectPath":"/projects/jidekaixin2dian/fps-tune/","trendDate":"2026-09-21","taxonomy":{"languages":["csharp"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/paving-base/apk-installer","tags":["github-trending","daily","C#"],"title":"Paving-Base / APK-Installer","author":"Paving-Base","github":{"url":"https://github.com/Paving-Base/APK-Installer"},"metrics":{"lang":"C#","forks":167,"stars":1703,"today":4},"summary":"An Android Application Installer for Windows","sourceId":"github-trending-cn","authorUrl":"https://github.com/Paving-Base","githubUrl":"https://github.com/paving-base/apk-installer","externalId":"daily-Paving-Base/APK-Installer","sourceName":"GitHub Trending·中文圈","publishedAt":null,"sourceIds":["github-trending-cn"],"productId":"prd_636ad4c5dbc8b2a322b1923d","projectPath":"/projects/paving-base/apk-installer/","trendDate":"2026-09-12","taxonomy":{"languages":["csharp"]}},{"url":"https://github.com/sonarr/sonarr","tags":["github-trending","daily","C#"],"title